# Compiled example programs.
#
# `go build ./examples/native-window/` writes its binary into the directory it
# is run from, which is the repository root, not next to the source, so these
# match names rather than a path under examples/. Three such binaries were
# committed before the pattern was right.
#
# A list by name needs a line per example and silently misses a new one, which
# is how the fifth of them nearly went in. TestNoCompiledBinaryIsTracked is the
# guard that does not depend on anyone remembering to add the line.
/native-window
/web-window
/tray-only
/full-shell
/widget-gallery

# Snapshot comparisons a failing render writes beside its reference.
*.actual.png

# Go build and test output
*.exe
*.wasm
*.test
*.out

# macOS
.DS_Store
